  (54587, 2, 0, 'You fight honorably, friend.', 12, 0, 100, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tushui Trainee'),
  (54587, 3, 0, 'Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tushui Trainee'),
  (54587, 4, 0, 'I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tushui Trainee'),
  (54611, 0, 0, 'A challenger approaches.', 12, 0, 100, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 0, 'You''ve been trained well.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 1, 'Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 2, 'Amazing! You''re much stronger than you look.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 3, 'It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 4, 'I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 1, 5, 'It was an honor to be defeated by you.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro to Player'),
  (54611, 2, 0, 'Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro'),
  (54611, 3, 0, 'You''ve been trained well.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jaomin Ro'),
  (54856, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life."', 16, 0, 100, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 1, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "It is good to see you again, Aysa. You''ve come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek."', 16, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 2, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him."', 16, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 3, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within."', 16, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 4, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo''s presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you."', 16, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 5, 0, 'Master Li Fei''s voice echoes, "Go, children. We shall meet again very soon."', 16, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54856, 6, 0, 'Master Li Fei fades away.', 16, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Master Li Fei to Player'),
  (54943, 0, 0, 'Shhhh! Come quietly. She''s practicing.', 12, 0, 100, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Merchant Lorvo to Player'),
  (56503, 0, 0, 'Master Shang has trained you well. Thank you, friend!', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Min Dimwind to Player'),
  (56503, 1, 0, 'I couldn''t have fought them off alone. Now, if you''ll excuse me, I should go find my cart.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Min Dimwind to Player'),
  (56503, 2, 0, 'Cart!', 14, 0, 100, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Min Dimwind to Player'),
  (56503, 3, 0, 'Hello, cart. Still upside-downed, I see.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Min Dimwind to Player'),
  (59642, 0, 0, 'Keep those creatures at bay while I meditate. We''ll soon have the answers we seek.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),
  (59652, 0, 0, 'Meet me up in the cave if you would, friend.', 12, 0, 100, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),
  (60176, 0, 0, 'The fire spirit is upset. It''s dangerous to enter the shrine now...', 12, 0, 100, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Huojin Monk to Player'),
  (60183, 0, 0, 'I hope you''re ready, $p. Jaomin Ro awaits you just over the bridge.', 12, 0, 100, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Trainee Nim to Player'),
  (60244, 0, 0, 'You''re departing so soon?  I am envious of your prowess, $c. Good luck to you.', 12, 0, 100, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Trainee Guang to Player'),
