  (65471, 4, 0, 'That was a good match. Thank you.', 12, 0, 100, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Huojin Trainee'),
  (65471, 5, 0, 'Your skills are too great. I yield.', 12, 0, 100, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Huojin Trainee'),
  (65471, 6, 0, 'I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others.', 12, 0, 100, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Huojin Trainee'),
  (56013, 0, 0, 'You''ve all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Spirit of Master Shang Xi - sniff m2#103868 (31450 accept)'),
  (56013, 1, 0, 'It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Spirit of Master Shang Xi - sniff m2#104186 (6.4 s after the choice)'),
  (54786, 0, 0, 'Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8100'),
  (54786, 1, 0, 'There is a much larger problem we face now, my students. Shen-zin Su is in pain. If we do not act, the very land on which we stand could die, and all of us with it.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8277'),
  (60250, 0, 0, 'Hey there! Are you the one that brought back the fire spirit?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8374'),
  (60250, 1, 0, 'Of course he was hot! Don''t be dumb, Deng.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8541'),
  (60250, 2, 0, 'Nuh uh. Bet they could for sure kick you over that hill, though! Hah!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8878'),
  (60250, 3, 0, 'Okay bye.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8993'),
  (60249, 0, 0, 'Was he hot?  I bet he was hot!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8498'),
  (60249, 1, 0, 'I bet you''re really strong, huh?  You could probably kick that bridge right in half if you wanted to!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #8715'),
  (60249, 2, 0, 'Bye!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #9012'),
  (55694, 0, 0, 'Hey $p! This way to Morning Breeze Village.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #30997'),
  (65558, 0, 0, 'Let''s tackle this one together!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #38640'),
  (55744, 0, 0, 'Wait!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #48615'),
  (55744, 1, 0, 'Wait for another opening. I''ll meet you on the far side.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #49263'),
  (56159, 0, 0, 'Come child. We have one final journey to take together before your training is complete.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #51546'),
  (56686, 0, 0, 'For 3,000 years, we have passed the knowledge of our people down. Elder to youth. Master to student.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #55967'),
  (56686, 1, 0, '$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #56286'),
  (56686, 2, 0, 'Now Shen-zin Su is ill, and we are all in danger. With the help of the elements, you will break the silence. You will speak to him.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #56486'),
  (56686, 3, 0, 'Aysa and Ji have retrieved the spirits and brought them here. You are to go with them, speak to the great Shen-zin Su, and do what must be done to save our people.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #56660'),
  (56686, 4, 0, 'You''ve come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #56796'),
  (56660, 0, 0, '$p, where''s Master Shang?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57297'),
  (56660, 1, 0, 'Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I''m going to miss the old man.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57358'),
  (56660, 2, 0, 'When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57400'),
  (56660, 3, 0, 'A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57733'),
  (56660, 4, 0, 'How could such a thing cause pain to something so large?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57745'),
  (56660, 5, 0, 'Are you seeing what I''m seeing?!  Is that a boat?!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57824'),
  (56660, 6, 0, 'And those aren''t pandaren down there.  They''ve got no fur.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57913'),
  (56661, 0, 0, '...Ji, they were in the Wood of Staves.  You know where Master Shang is now.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57317'),
  (56661, 1, 0, 'Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57385'),
  (56661, 2, 0, 'I might if you embarrass us.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57436'),
  (56661, 3, 0, 'Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We''ve sensed your pain, and we want to help.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57482'),
  (56661, 4, 0, 'What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57493'),
  (56661, 5, 0, 'Of course, Shen-zin Su!  But your shell is large, and I do not know where this thorn could be.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57672'),
  (56661, 6, 0, 'We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57708'),
  (56661, 7, 0, 'We''ll know soon enough.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57782'),
  (56661, 8, 0, 'It is a boat... a whole airship!  That''s a bigger thorn than I was expecting.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #57848'),
  (56661, 9, 0, 'Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #58070'),
  (56661, 10, 0, 'We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #58276'),
  (56676, 0, 0, 'I am in pain, but it warms my heart that Liu Lang''s grandchildren have not forgotten me.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57522'),
  (56676, 1, 0, 'There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57551'),
  (56676, 2, 0, 'The pain is unbearable, and I can no longer swim straight.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57582'),
  (56676, 3, 0, 'Please grandchildren, can you remove this thorn?  I cannot do so on my own.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57624'),
  (56676, 4, 0, 'It is in the forest where your feet do not walk.  Continue along the mountains and you will find it.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57687'),
  (56676, 5, 0, 'Thank you, grandchildren.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'sniff m2 #57719'),
  (59986, 0, 0, '$n''s here. Let''s go.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #59435'),
  (59986, 1, 0, 'Wha...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #59911'),
  (59986, 2, 0, 'The gate is jammed.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #59952'),
  (59988, 0, 0, 'Let me try.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #59976'),
  (59988, 1, 0, 'Did they prop this door up against a boulder?  It won''t budge!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #60038'),
  (59988, 2, 0, 'Well done, Jojo!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #60280'),
  (60900, 0, 0, 'Let''s go find this engineer.  Maybe getting this thorn removed won''t be as hard as we thought.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #64995'),
  (60729, 0, 0, 'Ji may kill Shen-zin Su if we let him go through with this! Come with me, $p, quickly!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #80995'),
  (60729, 1, 0, 'Ji, stop! This is reckless and stupid.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81231'),
  (60729, 2, 0, 'If you stop this, then maybe we can come up with one.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81310'),
  (60729, 3, 0, 'Doing THIS risks everything!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81343'),
  (60729, 4, 0, 'Ji... if this is what you must do, I will not stop you, but we could lose everything. I hope you''re right.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81374'),
  (60729, 5, 0, 'Aysa sighs.', 16, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81382'),
  (60741, 0, 0, 'Aysa, this is our only option. We blow the ship free, then we heal his wound. We have no other solution.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81257'),
  (60741, 1, 0, 'So we just wait until we think of something? Shen-zin Su is dying! Doing nothing risks everything!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81323'),
  (60741, 2, 0, 'I''d rather die knowing that at least we tried.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 #81355'),
  (56236, 0, 0, 'I''m... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 AT 7087'),
  (56236, 0, 1, 'Thank you for the timely rescue, hero.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 AT 7087'),
  (56236, 0, 2, 'I owe you my life.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sniff m2 AT 7087'),
